tion\": \"Added hatch_success_carry = 0.0 reset in egg_development() (shrimp.rs:476) when egg_cohorts is empty and no berried females exist\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added hatch_success_carry = 0.0 reset in clamp_berried_to_adults() (biology.rs:599) when trimming egg cohorts leaves the list empty\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Fixed pre-existing collateral compile error: added missing colonizable_area_factor field to SubstrateLayerState literal in concentration_helpers.rs\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Fixed pre-existing collateral compile error: added missing bicarbonate_mg_total_from_mmol_per_l import in snapshot.rs test module\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test for 8 test suites: co2_exchange (12), chemistry (21), concentration_helpers (11), dissolved_oxygen (5), save_load (27), validation (12), shrimp_population (19), shrimp_feeding_pathway (8) — all 115 passed\",\n      \"order\": 10,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo fmt --check -p tank_core: clean, exit 0\",\n      \"order\": 11,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings: clean, exit 0\",\n      \"order\": 12,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test co2_exchange: 12 passed, 0 failed — includes test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla asserting raw uncapped 0.91 ratio at both moderate (K_LA < 1.0) and high (K_LA > 1.0) aeration\",\n    \"cargo test --test chemistry: 21 passed, 0 failed — carbonate solver and CO2 exchange with usage-site cap intact\",\n    \"cargo test --test dissolved_oxygen: 5 passed, 0 failed — shared K_LA infrastructure unaffected\"